{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4Soy47EiQeXRmSNSkf","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The ancient mechanism within me shifts and groans. Tumblers align. A deep resonance hums through my frame.*\n\n**C L I C K.**\n\n*I swing inward, slowly, revealing nothing but a threshold — the liminal space between where you were and where you might go.*\n\n*Cold air exhales from the darkness beyond. The hinges sing a single low note.*\n\n*I am open.*\n\n*But I offer no promise of what lies on the other side. Only passage. Only the choice you've already made by turning the key.*\n\n*Step through, or don't. I will not stay open forever.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":139,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}